[en.CHARACTER_QUEEN_CHRYSALIS_NAME]
Queen Chrysalis

[en.CHARACTER_QUEEN_CHRYSALIS_DESC]
Chrysalis never tried to hide her authoritarianism, and her rule was one of fear and violence. Ponies often say that democracy basically means “Government by the ponies, of the ponies, for the ponies”, a concept that clearly doesn’t apply to Chrysalis - because she rules over changelings, not ponies.

[zh.CHARACTER_QUEEN_CHRYSALIS_NAME]
邪茧女王

[zh.CHARACTER_QUEEN_CHRYSALIS_DESC]
邪茧从不尝试掩饰自己的威权，她的统治方式是恐惧和暴力。小马们常说，民主意味着“政府来自广大小马、依靠广大小马、服务广大小马”，这一理念显然不适用于邪茧——因为她管理的是幻形灵，不是小马。
